<a target="_blank" href="http://nar.oxfordjournals.org/content/41/D1/D793">Kamburov, A. <i>et al</i>. (2013) The ConsensusPathDB interaction database: 2013 update. <i>Nucleic Acids Res.</i></a><!-- 39:D712-717.</a> --> <br>
<a target="_blank" href="http://nar.oxfordjournals.org/content/39/suppl_1/D712.long">Kamburov, A. <i>et al</i>. (2011) ConsensusPathDB: toward a more complete picture of cell biology. <i>Nucleic Acids Res.</i></a><!-- 39:D712-717.</a> --> <br>
<a target="_blank" href="http://nar.oxfordjournals.org/cgi/content/full/gkn698">Kamburov, A. <i>et al</i>. (2009) ConsensusPathDB--a database for integrating human interaction networks. <i>Nucleic Acids Res.</i></a><!-- 37:D623-628.</a> --> <br>
